<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 / 套路层面</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>隐藏套路名称的混合训练</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={330} viewBox='0 0 700 330'><rect x='0' y='0' width='700' height='73' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='350.0' y='30.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第一档 · 有套路提示能完成</text><text x='350.0' y='56.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>给出套路名称或提示后可以完成</text><path d='M342 74 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='85' width='700' height='73' rx='8' fill='#1B4E8C'/><text x='350.0' y='115.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第二档 · 无套路提示能选对方法</text><text x='350.0' y='141.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>题面不显示套路名与分类标签，学生自行判断</text><path d='M342 159 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='170' width='700' height='73' rx='8' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='350.0' y='200.5' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第三档 · 选对方法后能独立执行</text><text x='350.0' y='226.5' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>在没有提示的条件下完整完成</text><path d='M342 244 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='255' width='700' height='73' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='350.0' y='285.5' font-size='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>作答后复盘再展示对应关系</text><text x='350.0' y='311.5' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>教师与批改系统保留参考结构</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三档能力</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>专项训练之外增加跨套路混合练习，题面不提前显示目标套路名称、分类标签或泄露解法的提示。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>含两类题：题面不同而方法相同；外观相似但适用条件不同。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>允许多种合理解法，不把偏离参考套路直接判错。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>不作为六步循环之外机械追加的第七阶段，可安排在变式训练和延迟复查中，与专项练习分别记录，纳入统一时间预算。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>该功能为新增设计方向，不作为当前已实现能力。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：套路层面设计思路.md §3.1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 41 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>